        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用“我的 %@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used to encrypt backup files": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于加密备份文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vault Unavailable": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法打开账号数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verify your identity to view your codes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "验证身份后才能查看验证码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Website Icon": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网站图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, SuperOTP asks for %@ when it opens and after it has been in the background.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，打开应用以及从后台返回时需要验证%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When there are more backups than this, the oldest ones are deleted. Set it to 0 to keep them all.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超出后自动删除最旧的备份，设为 0 表示全部保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Work": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works offline. The only network request is fetching a website icon when you ask for one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "离线可用。唯一的联网操作是在你需要时获取网站图标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wrong password, or the file is damaged": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码不对或文件已损坏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your accounts could not be opened. If the device was just restarted, unlock it and try again.\n\n%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法打开账号数据。如果设备刚刚重启，请先解锁设备再重试。\n\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is already on this device. Replace it, or keep both.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」已在本机。可以覆盖原条目，也可以两条都保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
